1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
[narrator] Heavens Arena.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The 251-story building,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
which stands 991 meters tall

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
is a mecca for fighters.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
When combatants win a fight,
they may advance by one class

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
and receive a corresponding reward.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
After reaching the 100th floor,

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
they are assigned a private room.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
And those contestants
who are skilled and fortunate enough

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
to reach the 200th floor,

11
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
earn the right to challenge
the strongest fighters, the Floor Masters,

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
in an intense battle for survival.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
This is without a doubt

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
the best stage a warrior could ask for.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
[theme song playing]

16
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,000
[Wing] Only one thing
can protect you from a user of Nen.

17
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
You must learn to use it yourself...

18
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,000
and use Ten for defense.

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Otherwise...

20
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Your body will be shattered
beyond all recognition.

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:30,000
AWAKENING x AND x POTENTIAL

22
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,000
[narrator] As the hour grows late,

23
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Wing’s lecture has reached its climax.

24
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
They have until midnight.

25
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Gon and Killua must learn
how to use Nen

26
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
before the clock strikes twelve.

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Nen is a power that dwells
within every single human person.

28
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
However, at the present time,

29
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,000
only a few are capable
of using that power.

30
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
And because of their ability,

31
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
they are treated as geniuses,

32
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,000
leaders, psychics, sages,
and even super humans.

33
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,000
A power that dwells within everyone?

34
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,000
[Wing] Yes.

35
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
And there are means
by which to awaken this power.

36
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,000
But only two.

37
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Either slowly and carefully or by force.

38
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Zushi opted for the slow and careful path.

39
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Not only was he a quick learner,

40
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
but he was tireless in his training,

41
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:29,000
so he was able to master Ten
in a very short time.

42
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
About six months.

43
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
But that’s way too long!

44
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,000
We need to learn Ten and pass Hisoka

45
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,000
and we’ve gotta do it before midnight!

46
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Then it seems force is our only choice.

47
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,000
But is that gonna be fast enough?

48
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Exactly how long it takes

49
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
is up to you and how well you learn

50
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:51,000
to contain your aura in that short time.

51
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,000
So, let’s get right to it, shall we?

52
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
I will begin your training

53
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,000
by transmitting my aura in your direction.

54
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,000
This is Hatsu, which you saw earlier.

55
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:08,000
And of course, it goes without saying that
because I wish you no harm,

56
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
I’ll go easy on you.

57
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:13,000
But this method is still a drastic one.

58
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
In other words,

59
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
I will attempt to shock you
into awakening.

60
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
I will rouse your sleeping bodies
with a jolt,

61
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,000
making it so
that you can perform Ten easily.

62
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,000
The reason I say ‘sleeping’

63
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
is that your aura nodes
are currently closed,

64
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
preventing the free flow of aura.

65
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,000
And so, you see

66
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
by transmitting my aura through you,

67
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
I am hoping to jolt those nodes
into an open position.

68
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,000
AURA NODES: NODES WITHIN BODY
WHICH RELEASE AURA.

69
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Under normal circumstances you would
spend your time training, in meditation,

70
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,000
learning how to sense your own aura
that surrounds you,

71
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,000
slowly and carefully allowing
those nodes to fully open.

72
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Even a natural talent like Zushi here,

73
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
required three months.

74
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
But considering your abilities,

75
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:10,000
you could’ve accomplished it
in a week or less.

76
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Which is why it’s unfortunate

77
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:18,000
that we are being forced to use
the drastic method.

78
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,000
I don't really get it.

79
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
What’s the problem?

80
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:24,000
I thought faster is always better,
isn’t it?

81
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
This method is a cheat
and is highly frowned upon.

82
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
We are skipping the proper steps.

83
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:34,000
If I was inexperienced
or bore any malicious intent,

84
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
I could kill you.

85
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Yeah, but you aren’t inexperienced
or malicious.

86
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,000
So, we’re safe with you.

87
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Right?

88
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,000
[sighs]

89
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,000
And that’s why I’ve been wondering…

90
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,000
ENVELOPE SUPPRESS
REFINE ACT

91
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
[Killua] What made you decide
to teach us the real Four Exercises

92
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,000
all of a sudden?

93
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
Because you are very close to getting it.

94
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:00,000
If you were to enter the 200th floor
without any of this knowledge,

95
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
you would suffer greatly.

96
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:06,000
You see, up there,
everyone knows how to manipulate Nen.

97
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,000
And it is customary
to initiate any new arrivals

98
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:15,000
who are ignorant of Nen
by attacking with it.

99
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
In other words,
they do what I am about to

100
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,000
but without the necessary restraint.

101
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
They do not care if people die.

102
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
It’s all the same to them.

103
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Only those who prove
they are strong enough to survive

104
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
are welcome to stay there...

105
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
as the chosen.

106
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,000
They have paid a high price
for the privilege.

107
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:42,000
That is why it’s important for you
to be prepared.

108
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,000
I don’t expect any of that
was very encouraging

109
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,000
but through this method

110
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
I believe you will awaken.

111
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
It is clear you have the talent

112
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,000
and ability.

113
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:57,000
Take off your jackets, face away from me

114
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,000
and put down all your belongings.

115
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[Gon] It’s so hot!

116
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:14,000
And I can feel this pressure,

117
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,000
even though I know Mister Wing
isn’t touching me.

118
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[Killua] This is it!

119
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,000
That sensation…

120
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:25,000
It’s like some slimy, invisible thing
crawling across my skin.

121
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Multiply this by a few million

122
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,000
and it’d feel exactly
like my brother’s Nen.

123
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,000
Now I’ll begin.

124
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,000
[strangled cry]

125
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
[strangled cry]

126
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,000
And now every Aura Node in your body
has been opened.

127
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Thi-- This is…

128
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:59,000
That, gentlemen, is your aura,
also known as life energy.

129
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,000
You can see it now

130
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:03,000
because the nodes in your eyes
were also opened.

131
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,000
It almost looks like...

132
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,000
steam rising off the spout of a teakettle.

133
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,000
It’s so crazy!

134
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:12,000
It’s rushing out
from every part of my body!

135
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
And it doesn’t look like it’s stopping!

136
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
No way… This can’t be good!

137
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
What you see is your life energy,

138
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:23,000
so if it continues to escape,
you will become quite tired.

139
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:28,000
Expend all of your aura and you will
collapse from extreme fatigue.

140
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,000
Oh, I get it.

141
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,000
Listen to me carefully!

142
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,000
You must keep your focus
on containing your aura within your body.

143
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Now close your eyes!

144
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Use any stance you prefer.

145
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Whatever helps you to maintain your focus.

146
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:49,000
Visualize your aura flowing through you

147
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,000
as if it were blood
flowing through your body.

148
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:54,000
From the top of your head
to your right shoulder,

149
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,000
to your hand,

150
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:59,000
through your legs
then up your left side.

151
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,000
And now visualize that flow

152
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,000
as little by little

153
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,000
it begins to gradually slow down
and swirl around your body.

154
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,000
These boys are incredible.

155
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:24,000
They didn’t even need me to tell them

156
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:27,000
that a natural stance
would be the most effective.

157
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:32,000
They’ve mastered the technique
after only a few simple directions.

158
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,000
It’s magnificent

159
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
and terrifying.

160
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,000
Now slowly open your eyes.

161
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Tell me how you feel.

162
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
I feel like…

163
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,000
like I’m surrounded
by some viscous liquid.

164
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:52,000
It feels like
I’m wearing weightless clothes.

165
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:56,000
I want you both to continue
holding on to those images.

166
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,000
Once you assimilate them,

167
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,000
you’ll be able to do this in your sleep.

168
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:10,000
Next, I will proceed
to emit malicious Nen against you!

169
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,000
Before your nodes were forced open,

170
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:20,000
standing within this would’ve caused
excruciating pain.

171
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Yeah, okay.

172
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
I get it now.

173
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Your whole ‘blizzard’ analogy.

174
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,000
It makes sense.

175
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,000
[Wing] If you can fend off my Nen,

176
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:34,000
you will finally be able
to break through his barrier as well!

177
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
Prepare yourselves!

178
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,000
[Gon and Killua screaming]

179
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,000
[footsteps]

180
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,000
Mmm.

181
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,000
Welcome to the 200th floor.

182
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:45,000
Seems I needn’t bother
with the traditional initiation.

183
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:51,000
I think I can guess
why you’ve come to Heavens Arena.

184
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
You intended to get some training in
before challenging me, correct?

185
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,000
That’s right.

186
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:01,000
But I didn’t expect
I was gonna find you here.

187
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:03,000
That saves me some trouble.

188
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
[chuckles]

189
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:09,000
I wouldn’t get too brash
just because you learned to use Ten.

190
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,000
There is much to learn about Nen.

191
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,000
To be honest,

192
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:19,000
I feel absolutely no urge
to fight you right now.

193
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
However...

194
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:28,000
If you manage to win
a single match on this floor,

195
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,000
I’ll accept your challenge.

196
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Let's go.

197
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,000
Newcomers?

198
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,000
Looks like it, huh?

199
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:54,000
[Riehlvelt] It appears they can use it.

200
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,000
[Sadso] Indeed…

201
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,000
RECEPTION DESK

202
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Welcome to the 200th floor!

203
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,000
Please go ahead
and fill out all these forms.

204
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,000
So, would you like to register
for a match right now?

205
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:20,000
And because this level incorporates
a self-service system,

206
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:23,000
you’re permitted 90 whole days
of fight preparation.

207
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,000
During those ninety days

208
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,000
you can call me for a fight
any time you desire.

209
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,000
You’re free to fight every day, of course.

210
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
Or if you’d prefer,
you can wait until the very last minute.

211
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,000
It’s up to you!

212
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,000
Once you’ve participated in a fight,

213
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:39,000
your 90 days of preparation time
starts over again.

214
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:43,000
However, if you don’t fight
before the end of the 90 days,

215
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,000
you’ll be disqualified

216
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,000
and your name will be stricken
from all of the official records.

217
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,000
Wait, lemme get this straight.

218
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,000
We’re gonna have more than one fight
up on this level?

219
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,000
Yes.

220
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:56,000
The only way for you to clear this floor
is to rack up ten victories!

221
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:01,000
However, if you lose four times
before you secure ten wins,

222
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,000
you'll be disqualified.

223
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[buzzer]

224
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Also,

225
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,000
if you do win ten times,

226
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:11,000
your reward is that you’ll have a chance
to challenge the Floor Masters!

227
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,000
The Floor Masters

228
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,000
are the 21 strongest fighters
that Heavens Arena has to offer.

229
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:19,000
Each one
gets one whole floor to themselves

230
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,000
from 230 all the way to 250.

231
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Are you starting to understand now?

232
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
If you’re able to beat a Floor Master,

233
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,000
you win the honor and privilege

234
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
of becoming the new master of that floor!

235
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,000
Uh... but wait, there’s more!

236
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,000
The Floor Masters enjoy other perks!

237
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,000
Not the least of which

238
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:42,000
is you’ll be eligible to participate
in the Battle Olympia,

239
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
the Biennial Festival of Combat!

240
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Isn’t that so exciting?!

241
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Huh? No reaction?!

242
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,000
Sure, whatever you say, lady.

243
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Is there anything special
about the top floor?

244
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
That's what you want to know?

245
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,000
The champion of the Battle Olympia

246
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
gets to live on the top floor!
How about that?

247
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,000
It's an incredible honor!

248
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,000
A penthouse that’s a thousand meters up!
It’s a life of luxury!

249
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,000
Don't you get it?

250
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Yeah, but Killua,

251
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:14,000
your house is like 3700 meters up,
isn’t it?

252
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,000
But-- But wait!

253
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,000
There are other prizes!

254
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:23,000
-The champion always receives--
-Well? Whaddya think?

255
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,000
I dunno.
If that’s the floor’s big secret,

256
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:27,000
-I don't care anymore.
-Ooh!

257
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Yeah! I just want to fight with Hisoka!

258
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,000
Forget all that other stuff!

259
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,000
I don’t get it!

260
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Why did the two of you
even bother to come here?

261
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:40,000
Well, I guess that means
you’re just gonna have to win a fight.

262
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,000
But you’re gonna wait
a little while first, aren’t you?

263
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,000
[Gon] No way…

264
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,000
I’m ready!

265
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,000
These opponents are different

266
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:52,000
and I’m not leaving
‘til I find out just how different!

267
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:58,000
In that case, I’ll need you
to fill out this form as well.

268
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,000
‘kay!

269
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,000
[clatter]

270
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,000
[Killua] You want something?

271
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,000
Oh, no. Not really.

272
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,000
We’re simply waiting in line,

273
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,000
so we can register for a match. Right?

274
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,000
[cackling]

275
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:20,000
[chuckling]

276
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,000
Oh, I get it now.

277
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,000
Hey, Gon.

278
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,000
I think these guys wanna fight
on the same day you do.

279
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
[cackling]

280
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
I'm ready.

281
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Just let me know when I fight.

282
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,000
Well, you heard him.

283
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:52,000
That boy is brimming with energy, huh?

284
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,000
[slow cackling]

285
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,000
[chuckling]

286
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:01,000
Now, Mister Gon will be in room 2207

287
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:04,000
and Mister Killua in 2223.

288
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,000
We’ll let you know
which day your match is set.

289
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:11,000
Thanks a lot, Miss!

290
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,000
[Killua]
I’m willing to bet that those guys

291
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,000
must have gone
through the same tough initiation

292
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Four-Eyes was talking about.

293
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,000
[keys jangling]

294
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,000
If we’d gone in blind,

295
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,000
we both could’ve ended up
exactly like they did.

296
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:38,000
Wow! This room is huge!

297
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,000
[Killua] Hey! Aren’t you listening?

298
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Look at how sparkly the bathroom is!

299
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,000
Oh, wow!

300
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,000
I’ve never seen such a big bed
in my whole life!

301
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,000
Look, Killua!

302
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
[jingling signal]

303
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,000
Hey, Gon!

304
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:00,000
YOUR BATTLE HAS BEEN SET
FOR 3 P.M., MARCH 11!

305
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,000
What? Tomorrow?

306
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,000
That's fast.

307
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,000
[whoosh]

308
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:13,000
I don’t think I can win yet.

309
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,000
But that’s okay!

310
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,000
I just need the experience.

311
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,000
I need to find out

312
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:24,000
what I can do now that I have this power.

313
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
[cheering]

314
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,000
We’ve got a thrilling match
for you today, everyone!

315
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,000
First up is Gon,

316
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:44,000
who managed to zip straight to this floor
in no time at all!

317
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:49,000
His opponent will be Gido,

318
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
who currently holds a respectable record

319
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:53,000
of four wins and one loss!

320
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,000
[Gon stretching and grunting]

321
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:09,000
[cackling]

322
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
[Wing] Gon. Killua.

323
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Listen to me.

324
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,000
Ten is only defensive.

325
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:20,000
In terms of offense
it will offer you no advantage.

326
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
It is also important to remember

327
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,000
physical attacks will still cause damage.

328
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:29,000
An opponent who is highly skilled
in the use of Nen,

329
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,000
will be able to penetrate your Ten

330
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,000
and can easily deal you a lethal blow.

331
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:38,000
That’s why you should wait two months
before you start fighting.

332
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:40,000
During that time

333
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,000
I will teach you as much as I’m able.

334
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,000
[Gon] I’m really sorry, Mister Wing.

335
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,000
But I’m itching for a fight right now!

336
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,000
Goodness gracious.

337
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,000
That boy’s a real handful.

338
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,000
And... begin!

339
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
[cheering]

340
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:08,000
[roaring]

341
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:14,000
[cackling]

342
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:20,000
DANCING SPINNING TOPS

343
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:24,000
[commentator]
There they are, Gido's Dancing Tops!

344
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:27,000
He uses an arsenal
of dangerous spinning tops

345
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,000
to attack his opponent
and crush them into submission!

346
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,000
Here we go.

347
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Battle Waltz!

348
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
[gasps]

349
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:47,000
[grunts in pain]

350
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:50,000
[rasping in pain]

351
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,000
Clean hit!

352
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,000
[commentator] Gon gives up a hit!

353
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,000
One point to Gido!

354
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:00,000
He’s sure not wasting any time!

355
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Gon’s off to a rough start!

356
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,000
[groans quietly]

357
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,000
[Gido] I can use Nen

358
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,000
to keep these tops
attacking you for hours.

359
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,000
The attack pattern
is so incredibly complex

360
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,000
that no one knows
what they’ll do next!

361
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Not even me!

362
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:19,000
The tops are bouncing off each other
and attacking me.

363
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,000
They might be small,
but they pack a big punch.

364
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,000
Like a hammer!

365
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,000
[narrator] Gon has begun his first battle
on the 200th floor,

366
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:33,000
which is filled with Nen users.

367
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:36,000
It’s nothing at all like he expected.

368
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Will Gon survive this predicament?

369
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Or suffer defeat?

370
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:50,000
[theme song playing]

371
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,000
[Gon] Coming up:

372
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:59,000
-Gon...
-[Killua] ...and Killua’s…

373
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:00,000
[both] Hunterpedia!

374
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:02,000
-I’m Gon!
-I’m Killua!

375
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:04,000
[both] And this is our Hunterpedia!

376
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:06,000
Today, we’ll be introducing Gido!

377
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:08,000
He fights with tops controlled by Nen!

378
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:11,000
Maybe he’ll turn himself
into one and spin into you!

379
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:14,000
[both] Spin round and round!

380
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,000
[Gon] Next time:
"Fierce x And x Ferocious."

381
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,000
[Killua] Just don’t be too reckless.

382
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:25,000
[Gon] A real friend would want me
to be reckless.

383
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:27,000
[Killua] Okay, that’s reckless.
